## Highlights
1. A smartphone-assited biomimetic MOFs paper device was for POC detection reported.
2. The stability of paper biosensor was significantly elevated by armour-like ZIF-8 exoskeleton.
3. On-demand detection for different biomakers were achieved by modulating the enzyme cascades.
4. Real-time and on-site POC monitoring of glucose and uric acid in diabetes and gout events was achieved.
